--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_exists_admissible_smallConstants_botLayer_levelField_ringEquiv_of_descentBase_of_eq_two.lean

